oup_name", "content": "Take Away"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!"}}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "id": 11}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "_data": [], "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"images": [{"text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0, "image": "engenn7le07ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That was a great meal, Vanessa.  It was fun to check out Bistro 88. The food is great and the design is so cool!<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Thank you! I'm glad you came to try it out. I wish we served lemon baked cod every day! You might want to try it before the menu changes again. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Next time I go out with some friends for a meal, we'll come back.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sure! It's always fun to run into people I know. I wish Sally came out with us more often. You ought to invite her.", "time": "100", "id": 1, "image": "engenn7le07ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Can you tell me what is the most interesting part of your job? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: The people who work here get along very well. We're like a big family! <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Could you tell me what is the most difficult part?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanes